  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is negative or shows early negative momentum.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent price spikes — especially if sentiment is positive — to avoid underestimating upward momentum.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias when forecast is significantly below recent 7-day average and sentiment is neutral or slightly positive.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoot after sharp upward spikes — particularly if sentiment is positive but fading — to prevent overcorrection.",
    "Increase forecast lag correction when sentiment is positive and price is trending upward — anticipate delayed peak.",
    "Apply upward bias to forecasts when sentiment is positive and recent price is below 30-day moving average — signal potential breakout."
